    %{
      name: "robo.innovate Hackathon 2025",
      description: "Solve Real-World Problems with Robotics / AI and IoT\nAnyone passionate about hardware, software and latest technology should\u00A0join to tackle real-world problems through innovative solutions. As a Robotics / AI and IoT hub in Munich, robo.innovate collaborates with esteemed industry partners and TUM Venture Lab Robotics / AI to organize the event, offering a four-digit prize pool distributed among the winning teams. Students, makers, hackers, can participate individually or as a team in exciting challenges of our partners\u00A0and seize the unique chance to be part of the robo.innovate hackathon 2025.",
